       AND `the date the second communication was sent` AT MOST `s 1000(2) the last day for the registrar to send the second communication` `the date the first communication was sent`
    THEN JUST TRUE
    ELSE JUST FALSE -- FALSE-kind (the text says no in its own words): "must within 14 days after the expiration of that period send to the company a second communication"

