      `the second communication states that no answer to the first communication has been received` IS A BOOLEAN
      `the second communication states that if an answer is not received to it within 14 days from its date, a notice will be published in the Gazette with a view to striking the company's name off the register` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
