-- src:14145 | (ii) in Scotland or Northern Ireland, to imprisonment for a term not exceeding six months, or to a fine not exceeding the statutory maximum (or both).
@ref s 1007(7) Copy of application to be given to new members, employees, etc (src:14141-14145)
GIVETH A LIST OF Penalty
`s 1007(7) the penalty for a person guilty of an aggravated offence under section 1007` MEANS
